{"sequence": 29, "time_s": 4.196637, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d7s3", "title": "Osbeckia octandra", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d7s3", "text": "Fruits are dry capsules with numerous seeds.", "visible_time_s": 4.196634799998719, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Osbeckia octandra", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 30, "time_s": 4.19665, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d7s4", "title": "Osbeckia octandra", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d7s4", "text": "Leaves and young stems are edible, whereas leaves, stem and bark also widely used as a valuable medicine in Ayurveda for treating Diabetes mellitus, Hepatitis, Jaundice, and Hyperlipidaemia.", "visible_time_s": 4.196647599994321, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Osbeckia octandra", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 31, "time_s": 4.196665, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d7s5", "title": "Osbeckia octandra", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d7s5", "text": "The juice extracted from \"Osbeckia octandra\" leaves is an effective treatment for liver damage caused by Paracetamol poisoning", "visible_time_s": 4.196662599999399, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Osbeckia octandra", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 32, "time_s": 4.196679, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s0", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s0", "text": "Gordonia lasianthus (loblolly-bay, holly-bay, gordonia, or bay) is a small to medium-sized evergreen tree or shrub found in acid, swampy soils of pinelands and bays on the Atlantic and Gulf Coastal Plains of the southeastern United States.", "visible_time_s": 4.19667710000067, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 33, "time_s": 4.196695, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s1", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s1", "text": "It is a member of the Tea or Theaceae family.", "visible_time_s": 4.196692199999234, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 34, "time_s": 4.196709, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s2", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s2", "text": "It is slow growing with soft, light-colored(Varies in color from Cream to Carmine), fine-grained wood of little commercial value, although loblolly-bay could be managed as a source of pulpwood.", "visible_time_s": 4.196706299997459, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 35, "time_s": 4.196723, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s3", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s3", "text": "When older specimens are cut, the wood exudes a strong scent.", "visible_time_s": 4.196720499996445, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 36, "time_s": 4.196737, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s4", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s4", "text": "It is similar to a mixture of fresh oranges and pine sap.", "visible_time_s": 4.196734499993909, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 37, "time_s": 4.196763, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s5", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s5", "text": "The bark of the adult tree varies from medium grey to a red brown coloration.", "visible_time_s": 4.196759999998903, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 38, "time_s": 4.196777, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s6", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s6", "text": "Dead adult specimens of loblolly bay exhibit a lustorous shine when exposed to sunlight for several years.", "visible_time_s": 4.19677419999789, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 39, "time_s": 4.196813, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s7", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_short/d9s7", "text": "The white showy flowers and shiny foliage make it a desirable ornamental, but it is not easy to cultivate.", "visible_time_s": 4.196803799997724, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
